    {
      "text": "reasonable proposal for x1:T , it results in high variance estimates of ˆpθÅ.y1:T /. We study the population",
      "bbox": [
        48.08909606933594,
        243.74732971191406,
        443.60198974609375,
        253.51791381835938
      ],
      "direction": [
