        443.60296630859375,
        281.9470520019531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "depends on the trade-off between degeneracy of the ﬁlter, N, and design of the SMC mutation kernel.",
      "bbox": [
        48.087799072265625,
        283.5977478027344,
        443.60107421875,
        291.90960693359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Regarding the latter, we note the following.",
      "bbox": [
        48.087799072265625,
        293.560302734375,
        212.0922088623047,
        301.8721618652344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(a) A Rao–Blackwellized ﬁlter (Doucet et al., 2000) can improve acceptance rates; see Nevat et al.",
